        "bodyHtml": "<span>Passive:</span> <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Slam</span> damage is increased by <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">10/15/20/25/30%</span> (currently <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">((9 ~ 180) + (110% Attack Damage) + (40% Ability Power)) physical damage</span>).<br /><br /><span>Active:</span> Illaoi swings her idol, causing a Tentacle to <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Slam</span> forward.",
